      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If your app renders all pixels of the render target for a given frame, use the [`MTLLoadAction.dontCare`](mtlloadaction/dontcare.md) action, which allows the GPU to avoid loading the existing contents of the texture.",
      "normalizedSource": "If your app renders all pixels of the render target for a given frame, use the [`MTLLoadAction.dontCare`](mtlloadaction/dontcare.md) action, which allows the GPU to avoid loading the existing contents of the texture.",
