      "normalizedSource": "Otherwise, use the [`MTLLoadAction.clear`](mtlloadaction/clear.md) action to clear the previous contents of the render target or the [`MTLLoadAction.load`](mtlloadaction/load.md) action to preserve them.",
      "sourceHash": "d7549d6f378a0c7b061ed6d920299f02ca09f9c46f64277640e0299bf952abb8",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If your app renders all pixels of the render target for a given frame, use the [`MTLLoadAction.dontCare`](mtlloadaction/dontcare.md) action, which allows the GPU to avoid loading the existing contents of the texture.",
